      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}: Hey, _tau_. \n\nI think the issue may have been a one-off, because I didn't encounter it afterwards. I asked a friend for reference to back up my claim, that the Face Mirror wasn't working, but I think I was misinterpreting his findings.\n\nOne of my personal avatars, and a VRChat public avatar was not displaying in the Face Mirror while I was in EvolvedAnt's arcade world. I attempted to reset the configuration of the Face Mirror through the action wheel, but to no avail.\n\nRestarting VRChat apparently returned everything to normal.\n\nI sent my output logs (hopefully they were the right ones) to ticket #189036, if you're able to fetch them. If not, I can throw it in #open-beta-discussion later.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
